580	Create the TTL index once: `db.serp_cache.createIndex({ fetchedAt: 1 }, { expireAfterSeconds: 43200 })`. This is a normal index, not a search index, so it doesn't count against the 3. Expose `liveCheck` only to the real group, never on `/try`, so judges can't drain 250 searches.
