842	| **Render** asks for a card / build fails | — | Run the Mastra server on the laptop (`mastra dev`). **Drop the Render category.** Demo = video. The Temporal story loses the cold start but keeps the crash-resume |
843	| Render 512 MB OOM | Render logs "Out of memory" | Only the Mastra server runs on Render, which should fit (⚠ untested). Drop `@mastra/fastembed` if added; keep `lastMessages` ≤20 |
